ingredients:
  - "1/2 cup amaranth leaves (chopped)"
  - "1/3 cup wheat flour"
  - "1/3 cup ragi flour"
  - "5 dsp oil (absorbed)"
  - "1/2 tsp garlic paste"
  - "1/2 tsp ginger paste"
  - "1/4 tsp carom seeds"
  - "1/4 tsp black cumin seeds"
  - "Salt to taste"
instructions:
  - "Steam amaranth leaves and grind to a fine paste."
  - "Add 1 tbsp oil to sieved flour and mix properly."
  - "Add amaranth paste, ginger-garlic paste, salt, carom, and cumin seeds, and make a dough."
  - "Cover the dough with a wet cloth and let it rest."
  - "Divide dough into ten equal balls and roll into small chapaties."
  - "Heat oil and deep-fry each chapatti till they puff and become slightly brown on both sides."
  - "Serve hot with your favorite side dish."
